{"id":"4abdb0543c46f591","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-top3-compact-open-subbasis.md","title":"ZFC Top3 Compact Open Subbasis","display":"df-zfc-top3-compact-open-subbasis — ZFC Top3 Compact Open Subbasis","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top3-compact-open-subbasis","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top3-compact-open-subbasis"],"display":"df-zfc-top3-compact-open-subbasis — ZFC Top3 Compact Open Subbasis","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]","[[58-df-continuous-map]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top3-compact-open-subbasis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top3-compact-open-subbasis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top3-compact-open-subbasis — ZFC Top3 Compact Open Subbasis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"67cf48a2f6e27861\" href=\"?note=67cf48a2f6e27861\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset\">58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"58-df-continuous-map\">58-df-continuous-map</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3CompactOpenSubbasis}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop3CompactOpenSubbasis}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,S,\\mathcal C\">\\(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,S,\\mathcal C\\)</span> (parameters)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\)</span> (predicate from dependency)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3CompactOpenSubbasis}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop3CompactOpenSubbasis}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\)</span> (topological predicates)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top3\\text{-}compact\\text{-}open\\text{-}subbasis} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop3CompactOpenSubbasis}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,S)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\exists\\mathcal C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal C=\\{f\\in Y^X\\mid\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\}\\land S=\\{W\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\mid\\exists K\\subseteq X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau_Y\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(K,X,\\tau_X)\\land W=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C\\mid f[K]\\subseteq U\\})\\}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top3\\text{-}compact\\text{-}open\\text{-}subbasis} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop3CompactOpenSubbasis}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,S)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\exists\\mathcal C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal C=\\{f\\in Y^X\\mid\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\}\\land S=\\{W\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\mid\\exists K\\subseteq X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau_Y\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(K,X,\\tau_X)\\land W=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C\\mid f[K]\\subseteq U\\})\\}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Each subbasic set is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[K,U]=\\{f\\in C(X,Y):f[K]\\subseteq U\\}\">\\([K,U]=\\{f\\in C(X,Y):f[K]\\subseteq U\\}\\)</span>; the old pair set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\langle K,U\\rangle\\}\">\\(\\{\\langle K,U\\rangle\\}\\)</span> was only an index family, not a topology subbasis on the function space.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset","status":"resolved","id":"67cf48a2f6e27861","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-continuous-map","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-continuous-map]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3CompactOpenSubbasis}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,S,\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3CompactOpenSubbasis}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Continuous}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top3\\text{-}compact\\text{-}open\\text{-}subbasis} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop3CompactOpenSubbasis}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,S)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\exists\\mathcal C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal C=\\{f\\in Y^X\\mid\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\}\\land S=\\{W\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\mid\\exists K\\subseteq X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau_Y\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(K,X,\\tau_X)\\land W=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C\\mid f[K]\\subseteq U\\})\\}\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"[K,U]=\\{f\\in C(X,Y):f[K]\\subseteq U\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\langle K,U\\rangle\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1637,"backlinks":[{"id":"0569c193df3696fa","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop3CompactOpenSubbasis}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-top3-compact-open-subbasis]])"},{"id":"ca4615f704459c6c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3552","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-top3-compact-open-subbasis.md|58-df-zfc-top3-compact-open-subbasis]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["67cf48a2f6e27861","815e63e5071e7b58","3cd1834de4f2efb2"]}